 station config                                                                 host · unregistered
 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

 Terminal  2 ●  1 ◐  1 ○
   ● hushlogin          Silence the terminal login message
   ○ ghostty-dotfiles   The Ghostty config and its Catppuccin themes
     → station config install ghostty-dotfiles
   ◐ tmux-dotfiles      The tmux config                               differs from station's
     → station config install tmux-dotfiles
   ● starship-dotfiles  The Starship prompt config

 Security  1 ◐  1 ○
   ○ git-signing  Sign every commit with a GPG key          → station config install git-signing
   ◐ ssh-key      An ed25519 SSH key, kept in the Keychain  differs from station's
                                                            → station config install ssh-key

 → station config install <item...>
 → station config uninstall <item...>
